<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Fixlet>
    <Title>Install Rancher Desktop 0.6.0 (Current User)</Title>
    <Description>&lt;P&gt;Download and install Rancher Desktop 0.6.0 (for the Current User.)&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Note: Rancher Desktop can only be installed per-user (not system-wide), and so this BigFix Task is only relevant when the user is logged in to the target computer.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Note: Rancher Desktop only works on recent versions of Windows 10 and Windows&amp;nbsp;11 where Hyper-V and Windows Subsystem for Linux 2 (WSL)&amp;nbsp;are installed and setup (Microsoft&apos;s requirements detailed&amp;nbsp;&lt;A href=&quot;https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/install&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT color=#0066cc&gt;here&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/A&gt;.)&amp;nbsp;If&amp;nbsp;WSL is not installed when&amp;nbsp;launching Rancher Desktop,&amp;nbsp;then an error message will be shown. To install WSL, the official Microsoft instructions should be followed, or use the script based on these instructions created by the Rancher Desktop&amp;nbsp;installer (&amp;lt;System Drive&amp;gt;:\Windows\Temp\rancher-desktop-install.ps1) which installs WSL and the Hyper-V pre-requisite.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Rancher Desktop Website: &lt;A href=&quot;https://rancherdesktop.io/&quot;&gt;https://rancherdesktop.io/&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Rancher Desktop GitHub Repo: &lt;A href=&quot;https://github.com/rancher-sandbox/rancher-desktop&quot;&gt;https://github.com/rancher-sandbox/rancher-desktop&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/P&gt;</Description>
    <Relevance>not exists (it as string as version) whose(it &gt;= &quot;0.6.0&quot;) of values &quot;DisplayVersion&quot; of keys whose(value &quot;DisplayName&quot; of it as string starts with &quot;Rancher Desktop&quot;) of keys &quot;Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall&quot; of (user key of current user)</Relevance>
    <Relevance>1 = number of unique values of names of (logged on users;current users)</Relevance>
    <Source>Internal</Source>
    <SourceReleaseDate>2021-10-12</SourceReleaseDate>
    <MIMEField>
      <Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
      <Value>Wed, 13 Oct 2021 15:18:34 +0000</Value>
    </MIMEField>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <DefaultAction ID="Action1">
      <Description>
        <PreLink>Click </PreLink>
        <Link>here</Link>
        <PostLink> to deploy this action.</PostLink>
      </Description>
      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell">prefetch Rancher.Desktop.Setup.0.6.0.exe sha1:3af59d931298ab6f228d870a61456c066f482334 size:210710384 https://github.com/rancher-sandbox/rancher-desktop/releases/download/v0.6.0/Rancher.Desktop.Setup.0.6.0.exe sha256:dd408f9543ac54f153cf7bfb326aa8bac69748b76e98f5b4dc78a80a102c2bc7

override wait
hidden=true
completion=job
runas=currentuser
wait __Download\Rancher.Desktop.Setup.0.6.0.exe /S --no-desktop-shortcut</ActionScript>
    </DefaultAction>
  </Fixlet>
</BES>
